======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 109 - Distributed Tracing & Context Propagation
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Debugging a 5-second latency spike across 8 microservices using isolated log files.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Distributed tracing instrumented with OpenTelemetry and Jaeger.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
